{"sections":[{"slug":"局部闭嵌入","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"局部闭嵌入"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部闭嵌入</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"局部闭嵌入"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的局部闭嵌入是一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/闭嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">闭嵌入</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">后接一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/开嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">开嵌入</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">开嵌入后接闭嵌入也是局部闭嵌入</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但局部闭嵌入不一定能写成开嵌入后接闭嵌入</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}